==English==

===Etymology 1===
{{wp}}
{{swp|Delhi (disambiguation)}}
{{commonscat}}
Corrupted from {{bor|en|inc-hnd}} {{m|ur|دہلی|tr=dihlī, dêhli}} / {{m|hi|देहली}}, of {{unc|en|nocap=1}} origin. See [[w:Delhi#Toponym|Delhi § Toponym]] at Wikipedia. Compare {{cog|hi|दिल्ली}}.

